{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111427","id":2898582671,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sxNyP","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111427","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111427.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111427.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111427","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111427/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111427/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111427/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e40621925b53930d1c0f9086801d4104c97fb6a6","number":111427,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash when rearranging filtered animation tracks","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99713.\r\n\r\nThe root cause was using the real track index (unaffected by filtering) to index into a list of track edit controls (potentially smaller when filtered). Curiously, other than the crash when dropping a track at the bottom the correct control still somehow received focus. This is because there was another opposite index mixup cancelling it out: `_update_tracks()` fetched the index of the selected edit control but treated it as a real track index.\r\n\r\nI found at least one other edge case bug fixed by this PR, that I found no open issue for: Pasting a key via the Edit menu with a track selected and node filtering enabled would paste the key into the wrong track.\r\n\r\nFor convenience, pre-packaged MRP (original issue provided it as a .tscn code block): \r\n[animation-player-crash_2025-10-08_21-27-00.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22784760/animation-player-crash_2025-10-08_21-27-00.zip)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969